<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; color: #333; max-width: 600px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .body { line-height: 1.6; margin: 16px 0; }
        .highlight { font-weight: bold; color: #1a73e8; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 16px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Welcome to Classifieds</h2>
        <p class="greeting">Hello {{fullName}},</p>
        <div class="body">
            <p>Thank you for registering with Classifieds. Your account has been created successfully.</p>
            <p>You can now sign in to browse listings, post your own ads, and connect with buyers and sellers in your area.</p>
            <p>If you have any questions, visit our help center or contact support. We're here to help.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Classifieds Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
